{"id":"ca9848cce4cd0fc2","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-godel-numbering.md","title":"Minimal Gödel numbering interface (legacy)","display":"df-godel-numbering — Minimal Gödel numbering interface (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-godel-numbering","aliases":["27-df-godel-numbering"],"display":"df-godel-numbering — Minimal Gödel numbering interface (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-formula]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-godel-numbering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-godel-numbering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-numbering — Minimal Gödel numbering interface (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a> 及其项上游；引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Syn}_S,\\mathrm{GNum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Syn}_S,\\mathrm{GNum}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,k,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d,k,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。数值函数一元输入用自然数本身，多元输入用有限元组，下式以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\">\\(D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n\\)</span> 固定对应。</li>\n<li>引入全函数空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n\">\\(\\mathcal F_n\\)</span>、零函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>、后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Succ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Succ}\\)</span>、投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^n\">\\(\\pi_i^n\\)</span>、复合算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}\\)</span> 与原始递归算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}\\)</span> 的合法输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal F_m,(f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in\\mathcal F_n^m\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal F_m,(f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in\\mathcal F_n^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_n\\)</span> 的合法输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathcal F_n,h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\">\\(g\\in\\mathcal F_n,h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\)</span>。有限轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\\)</span> 明确按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,y\">\\(0,\\ldots,y\\)</span> 编号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 是下面从基底按自然数阶段生成的正元数值函数类，不是自然数子集的集合。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 引入总特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> 为函数像。</li>\n<li>不预先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GNum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GNum}_S\\)</span> 非空；角码记号只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{GNum}_S,e\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_S\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{GNum}_S,e\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\)</span> 使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_n\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&amp;n=1,\\\\\\mathbb N^n&amp;n\\neq1,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_1&amp;n=1,\\\\\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle&amp;n\\neq1,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\mathbb N^{D_n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_n\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&amp;n=1,\\\\\\mathbb N^n&amp;n\\neq1,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_1&amp;n=1,\\\\\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle&amp;n\\neq1,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\mathbb N^{D_n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Succ}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x+1\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\pi_i^n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),x_i\\rangle\\mid\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Succ}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x+1\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\pi_i^n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),x_i\\rangle\\mid\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,g(\\operatorname{pack}_m(\\langle f_1(u),\\ldots,f_m(u)\\rangle))\\rangle\\mid u\\in D_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,g(\\operatorname{pack}_m(\\langle f_1(u),\\ldots,f_m(u)\\rangle))\\rangle\\mid u\\in D_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_n(g,h)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),z\\rangle\\ \\middle|\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ y,z\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{\\{0,\\ldots,y\\}}\\;\\left[z_0=g(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x))\\land z_y=z\\land\\forall j\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N\\mid r&lt;y\\}\\;\\left(z_{j+1}=h(\\operatorname{pack}_{n+2}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j,z_j\\rangle))\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rec}_n(g,h)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),z\\rangle\\ \\middle|\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ y,z\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{\\{0,\\ldots,y\\}}\\;\\left[z_0=g(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x))\\land z_y=z\\land\\forall j\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N\\mid r&lt;y\\}\\;\\left(z_{j+1}=h(\\operatorname{pack}_{n+2}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j,z_j\\rangle))\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_0\\coloneqq\\{Z,\\mathrm{Succ}\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_0\\coloneqq\\{Z,\\mathrm{Succ}\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal P_{d+1}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathcal P_d\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\ \\middle|\\ m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ g\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_m,\\ (f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in(\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_n)^m\\right\\}\\\\&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{Rec}_n(g,h)\\ \\middle|\\ n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ g\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\right\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal P_d.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal P_{d+1}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathcal P_d\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\ \\middle|\\ m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ g\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_m,\\ (f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in(\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_n)^m\\right\\}\\\\&amp;\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{Rec}_n(g,h)\\ \\middle|\\ n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ g\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\right\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal P_d.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_E(k)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;k\\in E,\\\\0&amp;k\\notin E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_E(k)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;k\\in E,\\\\0&amp;k\\notin E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GNum}_S\\coloneqq\\left\\{g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathrm{Syn}_S}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall e_1,e_2\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\;(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\longrightarrow e_1=e_2)\\land\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(g)}\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GNum}_S\\coloneqq\\left\\{g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathrm{Syn}_S}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall e_1,e_2\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\;(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\longrightarrow e_1=e_2)\\land\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(g)}\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>已读取 57-df-primitive-recursive、57-df-composition-operator、57-df-primrec-operator 的实际 Assertion。这里内建其所需的正元数值函数基底与类型相容的复合/原始递归闭包；保留一元域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_1=\\mathbb N\">\\(D_1=\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使特征函数确为该 PR 类中的一元函数。旧稿 ran(g)∈PR 的集合/函数混淆已改为特征函数属于 PR。</li>\n<li>有限轨迹定义在全函数输入上存在且唯一，由自然数递归归纳得到，因此 Rec_n(g,h) 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(D_{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的全函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=0\">\\(y=0\\)</span> 时轨迹只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_0\">\\(z_0\\)</span>，步骤量词域为空。阶段并集是含基底并对合法算子闭合的最小类；外部旧源以类型不符时返回 Z 的全算子表示，同样不增加基底之外元素。</li>\n<li>本文件只保留旧稿意图中的单射、原始递归可识别像条件。它不自动保证代入、解析或推导检查在代码上可计算，也不对任意不可数字母表断言编码存在。没有因内建 PR 而扩充为另一套有效编码或计算性元理论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S$ 来自 [[27-df-formula]] 及其项上游；引入 $\\mathrm{Syn}_S,\\mathrm{GNum}_S$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Syn}_S,\\mathrm{GNum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d,k,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"D_n,\\operatorname{pack}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Succ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal F_m,(f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in\\mathcal F_n^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_n","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathcal F_n,h\\in\\mathcal F_{n+2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_E:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GNum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathrm{GNum}_S,e\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"D_n\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\mathbb N&n=1,\\\\\\mathbb N^n&n\\neq1,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_1&n=1,\\\\\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle&n\\neq1,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathcal F_n\\coloneqq\\mathbb N^{D_n}.","display":true},{"tex":"Z\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Succ}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,x+1\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\pi_i^n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x),x_i\\rangle\\mid\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,g(\\operatorname{pack}_m(\\langle f_1(u),\\ldots,f_m(u)\\rangle))\\rangle\\mid u\\in D_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_n(g,h)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle\\operatorname{pack}_{n+1}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,y\\rangle),z\\rangle\\ \\middle|\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n,\\ y,z\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\exists\\langle z_0,\\ldots,z_y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{\\{0,\\ldots,y\\}}\\;\\left[z_0=g(\\operatorname{pack}_n(\\vec x))\\land z_y=z\\land\\forall j\\in\\{r\\in\\mathbb N\\mid r<y\\}\\;\\left(z_{j+1}=h(\\operatorname{pack}_{n+2}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n,j,z_j\\rangle))\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_0\\coloneqq\\{Z,\\mathrm{Succ}\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal P_{d+1}\\coloneqq{}&\\mathcal P_d\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{Comp}_{m,n}(g;f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\ \\middle|\\ m,n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ g\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_m,\\ (f_1,\\ldots,f_m)\\in(\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_n)^m\\right\\}\\\\&\\cup\\left\\{\\mathrm{Rec}_n(g,h)\\ \\middle|\\ n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ g\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal P_d\\cap\\mathcal F_{n+2}\\right\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PR}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal P_d.\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_E(k)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&k\\in E,\\\\0&k\\notin E,\\end{cases}\\qquad\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Term}_S.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GNum}_S\\coloneqq\\left\\{g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathrm{Syn}_S}\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall e_1,e_2\\in\\mathrm{Syn}_S\\;(g(e_1)=g(e_2)\\longrightarrow e_1=e_2)\\land\\chi_{\\operatorname{ran}(g)}\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner e\\urcorner_g\\coloneqq g(e).","display":true},{"tex":"D_1=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D_{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"y=0","display":false},{"tex":"z_0","display":false}],"bytes":5031,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-225","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-godel-numbering|df-godel-numbering — Minimal Gödel numbering interface (legacy)]]"}],"outgoing":["1f9e71c9f1e5764e"]}